  "question": {
    "text": "Two moles of a gas at 8.21 bar and 300 K are expanded at constant temperature up to 2.73 bar against a constant pressure of 1 bar. How much work (in Latm) is done by the gas?<br />\r<br />\r(neglect the sign)"
  },
